NationalPark_Text_Youngster::
	.string "I get the other guy’s POKéDEX\n"
	.string "sticker if I win.$"

NationalPark_Text_BugCatcher::
	.string "I’m playing with stickers I printed\n"
	.string "from my POKéDEX.$"

NationalPark_Text_Woman2::
	.string "I take walks in the PARK, but I\n"
	.string "never go into the grass.\p"
	.string "Trainers always want to battle...$"

NationalPark_Text_Meowth::
	.string "PERSIAN: Fufushaa!$"

NationalPark_Text_WorkerF_1::
	.string "Pay attention, please!\p"
	.string "...Oops, I have to quit thinking like\n"
	.string "a teacher all the time.\p"
	.string "You must be a POKéMON trainer.\p"
	.string "Since you’re working so hard, I\n"
	.string "want you to have this.$"

NationalPark_Text_WorkerF_2::
	.string "Let a POKéMON hold that QUICK CLAW.\p"
	.string "Sometimes it will strike first\n"
	.string "during battle.$"

NationalPark_Text_Pokefan145Intro::
	.string "My POKéMON are so cute. Let me show\n"
	.string "them off to you.$"

NationalPark_Text_Pokefan145Defeat::
	.string "Maybe I can’t beat you in battle...\p"
	.string "But mine look a lot nicer.$"

NationalPark_Text_Pokefan145::
	.string "My friend has a MARILL. It’s so\n"
	.string "cute! I wish I had a MARILL.$"

NationalPark_Text_Lass::
	.string "Look! Check out my bag!\p"
	.string "I printed out my favorites from my\n"
	.string "POKéDEX and stuck them on my bag.$"

NationalPark_Text_Schoolboy480Intro::
	.string "The world of POKéMON is deep.\p"
	.string "There are still lots of things we\n"
	.string "don’t know.\p"
	.string "But I know more than you do!$"

NationalPark_Text_Schoolboy480Defeat::
	.string "Wha-wha-what?$"

NationalPark_Text_Schoolboy480::
	.string "There is a lot to learn.\p"
	.string "For example...\p"
	.string "There are 50 kinds of TM.\p"
	.string "Traded POKéMON level up faster.$"

NationalPark_Text_LassKriseIntro::
	.string "Hello? Why are you staring at me?\n"
	.string "Oh, a battle?$"

NationalPark_Text_LassKriseDefeat::
	.string "...Hmmm...$"

NationalPark_Text_LassKrise::
	.string "The way you were looking, I thought\n"
	.string "you liked me.\p"
	.string "After all, I am cute!$"

NationalPark_Text_PokefanWilliamIntro::
	.string "We adore our POKéMON, even if they\n"
	.string "dislike us.\p"
	.string "That’s what being a FAN is about.$"

NationalPark_Text_PokefanWilliamDefeat::
	.string "M-my POKéMON!$"

NationalPark_Text_PokefanWilliam::
	.string "I lost the battle, but my POKéMON\n"
	.string "win the prize for being most lovely.$"

NationalPark_Text_Woman3::
	.string "This is MAIL I got from my daughter.\n"
	.string "It cheers me up.$"

NationalPark_Text_GbaKid::
	.string "I’m printing out my POKéDEX.\p"
	.string "You can also print out stuff like\n"
	.string "MAIL and your PC BOXES.$"

NationalPark_Text_LittleBoy_1::
	.string "SUNNY: Hi!\p"
	.string "I’m SUNNY of Sunday, meaning it’s\n"
	.string "Sunday today!\p"
	.string "I was told to give you this if I saw\n"
	.string "you!$"

NationalPark_Text_LittleBoy_2::
	.string "SUNNY: That thing...\p"
	.string "Um...\p"
	.string "...What was it now...\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Oh! I remember now!\p"
	.string "A POKéMON that knows electric\n"
	.string "moves should hold it.\p"
	.string "My sis MONICA said it powers up\n"
	.string "electric moves!$"

NationalPark_Text_LittleBoy_3::
	.string "SUNNY: My sisters and brothers are\n"
	.string "MONICA, TUSCANY, WESLEY,\l"
	.string "ARTHUR, FRIEDA and SANTOS.\p"
	.string "They’re all older than me!$"

NationalPark_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "Who are you?\p"
	.string "Who am I?\n"
	.string "Glad you asked!\p"
	.string "My name is ARD, I’m a POKéMON\n"
	.string "TRAINER!\p"
	.string "However, I’m not like any other\n"
	.string "TRAINER out there!\p"
	.string "I’m a BUG POKéMON TRAINER!\p"
	.string "Bugs are awesome!\n"
	.string "They are the best!\p"
	.string "Why?\n"
	.string "Let me show you the strength of\l"
	.string "BUG POKéMON!$"

NationalPark_Text_Trigger1Defeat::
	.string "But... My bugs!$"

NationalPark_Text_Trigger1Victory::
	.string "Another victory for BUG POKéMON!$"

NationalPark_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "You are joking!\n"
	.string "My bug POKéMON lost to some\l"
	.string "rookie trainer...\p"
	.string "I know! You just cheated!\p"
	.string "I can’t believe you cheated!\n"
	.string "You’re a loser!$"

NationalPark_Text_Trigger1_3::
	.string "Listen, you just hurt my pride!\n"
	.string "So I’ll get my revenge!\p"
	.string "I’ll follow you to death if necessary\n"
	.string "only to show you the magnificence\l"
	.string "of bug POKéMON!$"

NationalPark_Text_Sign1::
	.string "RELAXATION SQUARE\n"
	.string "NATIONAL PARK$"

NationalPark_Text_Sign2::
	.string "What is this notice?\p"
	.string "Please battle only in the grass.\n"
	.string "NATIONAL PARK WARDEN’S OFFICE.$"

NationalPark_Text_Sign3::
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
	.string "Print out MAIL by opening it then\n"
	.string "pressing START.$"
